```console
$ scherzo-cloud delegation propose --help
Propose delegation to a service principal

Usage: scherzo-cloud delegation propose [OPTIONS] <SERVICE_PRINCIPAL>

Arguments:
  <SERVICE_PRINCIPAL>  Exact service principal ID

Options:
      --json                 Print the delegation result as JSON
      --allow-insecure-http  Allow this command's Scherzo Cloud requests over insecure HTTP connections
  -h, --help                 Print help

```
